171.m:
Madhucchandas said:
"Your father sits bound in the world of the gods, O noble-minded one;
through gambling and many vices, he has fallen from his kingdom.

172.m:
Brahmā said:
The Sāmudra tīrtha has been declared to bestow the fruits of all tīrthas;
I shall describe its true nature; listen attentively, Nārada.
